<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoInputDestroy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Free up resources used by an input</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Input.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoInputDestroy(SilikoInput *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoInputDestroy</function> function cleans up
<varname>object</varname>  by calling the function pointed to by the
<varname>destroy</varname> pointer in the <type>SilikoInputVTable</type>
of <varname>object</varname>, and then deletes <varname>object</varname>
itself.</para>
</refsection>
